    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Research Your Milestone\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\nChoose or locate your assigned AI milestone.\r\n\r\n1. Find your milestone card.\r\n\r\n2. Click the card to explore its details.\r\n\r\n3. Use the tabs to complete your timeline card activity guide.\r\n\r\n4. When you finish, cut out your timeline card and add it to the class timeline.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n#### Sources\r\n\r\n::: details [Alan Turing's Foundational Ideas]\r\nBritannica — Turing Test\r\nScience Museum — The Multiple Lives of Alan Turing\r\n:::\r\n::: details [Dartmouth Conference]\r\nIEEE Spectrum — Dartmouth AI Workshop\r\nOpen Digital AI — The Dartmouth Conference, 1956\r\n:::\r\n::: details [Symbolic AI]\r\nV&A — A History of Artificial Intelligence in 10 Objects\r\nBritannica — History of Artificial Intelligence\r\n:::\r\n::: details [ELIZA]\r\nSmithsonian Magazine — Why Joseph Weizenbaum Invented the ELIZA Chatbot\r\n99% Invisible — The ELIZA Effect\r\n:::\r\n::: details [Expert Systems]\r\nBritannica — Expert System\r\nHistory Tools — MYCIN: The Pioneering Expert System\r\n:::\r\n::: details [AI Winters]\r\nDataCamp — AI Winter: Understanding the Cycles of AI Development\r\nHolloway — The Second AI Winter (1987–1993)\r\n:::\r\n::: details [Machine Learning Shift]\r\nGeeksforGeeks — History and Evolution of Machine Learning\r\n:::\r\n::: details [Deep Learning]\r\nIEEE Spectrum — How AlexNet Transformed AI and Computer Vision\r\nA History of AI — AlexNet: When Deep Learning Became AI\r\n:::\r\n::: details [Transformers & Large Language Models]\r\nML Journey — Transformer vs BERT vs GPT\r\nTechRadar — What is a GPT?\r\n:::",
